  "prefLabel": "Ed 1015.01 Closing the Record of Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1015.01 Closing the Record of Services. The record of services of an individual who has achieved an employment outcome shall be closed only if all the requirements of 34 CFR 361.56 are met to include employment outcome achieved, employment outcome maintained, satisfactory outcome, and post-employment services.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
